    "advanced": {
      "type": "ces-science-feature",
      "blocks": {
        "f1": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Microneedle Technology",
            "reverse": false,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/hf_20260916_055718_c2279ecd-1695-4f2f-b399-8de9ebf6e6a8.png",
            "science_heading": "The Science",
            "science_text": "<p>Every CEBEAM patch is lined with hundreds of self-dissolving micro-cones made from cross-linked hyaluronic acid. On contact they create painless micro-channels through the skin's outer barrier, then dissolve completely — carrying their actives past the layer that blocks ordinary creams.</p>",
            "chips_heading": "Clinically shown to",
            "chip_1_label": "Boost Collagen",
            "chip_2_label": "Improve Absorption",
            "chip_3_label": "Smooth Fine Lines",
            "chip_4_label": "Firm & Lift",
            "nerds_collapsible": true,
            "nerds_heading": "For the Beauty-Nerds",
            "nerds_content": "<p><strong>Micro-channel creation:</strong> Micro-cones form transient channels through the stratum corneum without wounding living tissue, opening a direct route for actives.</p><p><strong>Collagen-induction:</strong> The controlled micro-stimulus signals fibroblasts to lay down new collagen and elastin in the treated zone.</p><p><strong>Self-dissolving delivery:</strong> Cones are made of the treatment itself, so nothing is wasted and there is no biohazard — they melt into the skin within minutes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f2": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Deep Active Delivery",
            "reverse": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/fnpnf.webp",
            "science_heading": "The Science",
            "science_text": "<p>Most of a topical serum never reaches the living skin — it sits on the surface and evaporates. CEBEAM's micro-channels bypass the stratum corneum and deliver a peptide-and-hyaluronic complex directly into the layers where fine lines and dark circles form.</p>",
            "chips_heading": "Clinically shown to",
            "chip_1_label": "Deeper Absorption",
            "chip_2_label": "Intense Hydration",
            "chip_3_label": "Deliver Peptides",
            "chip_4_label": "Brighter Under-Eyes",
            "nerds_collapsible": true,
            "nerds_heading": "For the Beauty-Nerds",
            "nerds_content": "<p><strong>Barrier bypass:</strong> Delivering below the stratum corneum raises the effective dose reaching target cells by many times versus a surface cream.</p><p><strong>Targeted concentration:</strong> Actives are deposited exactly under the eye, so a lower total dose does more work with less irritation.</p><p><strong>Sustained release:</strong> The dissolving hyaluronic matrix holds moisture and releases the complex gradually over the wear time.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f3": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Collagen Rebuild",
            "reverse": false,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/5bc7f757-a882-4e13-bd64-d22ba4cab1e6.png",
            "science_heading": "The Science",
            "science_text": "<p>Each micro-channel triggers a controlled micro-repair response. The skin reads it as a signal to rebuild — ramping up fibroblast activity and fresh collagen and elastin exactly where the eye area has thinned with age.</p>",
            "chips_heading": "Clinically shown to",
            "chip_1_label": "Increase Collagen",
            "chip_2_label": "Repair Tissue",
            "chip_3_label": "Improve Elasticity",
            "chip_4_label": "Accelerate Renewal",
            "nerds_collapsible": true,
            "nerds_heading": "For the Beauty-Nerds",
            "nerds_content": "<p><strong>Repair cascade:</strong> Micro-injury initiates the skin's natural wound-healing sequence — growth factors, fibroblast recruitment, and new matrix synthesis — without visible damage.</p><p><strong>Structural rebuild:</strong> New collagen and elastin thicken and firm the thin under-eye skin, softening crepiness and hollowing over a course of use.</p><p><strong>Cumulative results:</strong> Benefits compound across a program as each session builds on the last.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f4": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Targeted Eye Design",
            "reverse": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/hf_20260925_083543_c7f62231-0964-4fe4-b206-9ff425b61b3a.png",
            "science_heading": "The Science",
            "science_text": "<p>The crescent patch is contoured to the orbital bone so every micro-cone lands on the delicate under-eye — not the cheek. Worn overnight, it holds the actives in place for hours of uninterrupted, precise treatment.</p>",
            "chips_heading": "Clinically shown to",
            "chip_1_label": "Precise Placement",
            "chip_2_label": "Even Coverage",
            "chip_3_label": "Overnight Action",
            "chip_4_label": "Comfortable Wear",
            "nerds_collapsible": true,
            "nerds_heading": "For the Beauty-Nerds",
            "nerds_content": "<p><strong>Anatomical fit:</strong> The curved geometry follows the tear-trough so pressure — and therefore penetration — is even across the whole under-eye.</p><p><strong>Extended contact:</strong> Long overnight wear keeps micro-channels open and actives working far longer than a rinse-off treatment.</p><p><strong>Gentle by design:</strong> Flexible backing and ultra-fine cones make application comfortable and residue-free.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "f1",
        "f2",
        "f3",
        "f4"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "eyebrow": "THE SCIENCE",
        "heading": "Advanced Features",
        "intro": "<p>Two proven mechanisms — microneedling and deep active delivery — combined into one effortless overnight patch.</p>",
